OL,3,GNEWSAHealth board still paying for
OL,4,Aresearch despite criticism over patient
OL,5,Abenefit
OL,6,
OL,7,FA health board is continuing to pay
OL,8,Fmoney to a university research centre
OL,9,Fseveral months after a critical report
OL,10,Fwhich said the payments were not
OL,11,Fdirectly benefitting patients.
OL,13,FFigures show that the Betsi Cadwaladr
OL,14,FUniversity Health Board was due to pay
OL,15,FBangor University #110,686 this
OL,16,Ffinancial year to fund two researchers
OL,17,Fin the Centre for Mental Health and
OL,18,FSociety.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
