OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHealth board still paying for
OL,4,Aresearch despite criticism over patient
OL,5,Abenefit
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn internal NHS report, written in
OL,8,FJanuary, said "it is unclear what
OL,9,Fservices the health board are receiving
OL,10,Fand paying for, and how beneficial it
OL,11,Fis to the population of north Wales".
OL,13,FThe health board said it was addressing
OL,14,Fthe concerns and looking at
OL,15,Fimprovements in the way it works with
OL,16,Funiversities and research institutions.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
